---
Remove a game from the library

Usage: easyplay remove [OPTIONS] <GAME>

Arguments:
  <GAME>  The game

Options:
      --keep-storage  Keep its private Windows storage (prefix and home)
  -v, --verbose...    Increase log verbosity (-v debug, -vv trace)
  -h, --help          Print help
